TI  - Direct Tumour Seeding Following Medical Thoracoscopy in EGFR-Mutated Lung 
      Adenocarcinoma: A Case Report.
PG  - e70130
LID - 10.1002/rcr2.70130 [doi]
LID - e70130
AB  - This case demonstrates the risk of tumour seeding after medical thoracoscopy for 
      EGFR-mutated lung adenocarcinoma. Clinicians should balance the diagnostic 
      benefits against potential complications, closely monitor intervention sites, and 
      consider early local control strategies such as radiation therapy to effectively 
      manage procedure-related risks.
